      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5ed6d2e297cb2073c0eb034a|full_name}: It is possible to setup a button to mute and unmute yourself. All you have to do is go into your SteamVR overlay and find controller bindings and setup a custom binding. Then you can choose whatever button you want to have as a toggle mic button.\nEdit: This might only be a feature for Index users according to another post I saw. Sorry if this doesn't help.",
